.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:7:The current multi-ECC study supports exact functional verification, explicit analytical sensitivity calculations, and limited generic structural evidence. It contains no physical characterization and no hardware measurement.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:15:| Physical area/timing/power/energy | Not computable | Fields and technology context are null |
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:17:| Actual adaptive break-even | Not computable | MUX/controller/transition/re-encoding costs are null |
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:18:| Hardware/silicon/radiation behavior | Unsupported | No measurement campaign enters evidence |
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:26:- Partially verified TAEC is a SECDED-capable implementation with a disproved adjacent-triple claim, not a verified TAEC code.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:27:- The SEC-DAEC and cyclic-labelled candidates remain rejected even if a legacy family model assumes stronger coverage.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:31:- Fault profiles are uncalibrated sensitivity distributions, not measured SER or radiation spectra.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:33:- Energy per bit/XOR, leakage and scrub parameters are explicit analytical inputs.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:34:- Operational carbon uses scenario grid intensity; implementation-specific embodied carbon is absent.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:37:- Winner identity is conditional on the hard limits, grid and lexicographic energy rule.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:41:Generic cells, XOR counts, table literals and depth proxies are not physical cell area, timing, power, routing or energy. Technology independence applies only to exact algebraic/structural counts, not to physical conclusions. A defensible physical comparison would need the same PDK/library/corner, timing constraints, activity/workload, memory macro context and complete MUX/controller/transition accounting.
.\docs\LIMITATIONS_AND_VALID_CLAIMS.md:49:Do not state that GREEN-ECC-PHY currently demonstrates a measured percentage energy/carbon saving, a physical PPA winner, an adaptive hardware break-even, technology-independent implementation superiority, silicon reliability, or radiation qualification. Do not cite historical 27% energy or 19% carbon reductions unless a future current pipeline reproduces them with traceable inputs.
