.\docs\SCENARIOS_AND_WORKLOADS.md:32:Each profile assigns per-codeword-access probability to exact functional classes: single, adjacent double, non-adjacent double, adjacent triple and non-adjacent triple. The probabilities are explicit sensitivity inputs with provenance saying they are uncalibrated and not radiation measurements. Adjacency means consecutive encoded-codeword coordinates and never crosses a codeword, word, bank or page boundary.
